{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"733827355901952132","content":"Copper steps forward, “you claim that you were once raised by them. And I can safely assume most of you were as well. If that is the case, do you not remember the tender love and care that they showed to each of you? Do you not remember the kindness showed you? Many of them still wish to do that, to love and care for young uru. But by forcing it upon them, it scares them and makes many of them not want too at all. By showing them kindness, kindness will be shown in return.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T09:06:52.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746294239478153288","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
